WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Electronic music] Ideas. Interfaces. APIs. Devices. Production.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
A real-time server that authenticates clients and streams live device readings over WebSockets.

00:12.000 --> 00:26.000
Web, mobile, desktop and IoT clients connected through an API gateway to real-time, authentication and device-ingest services, backed by PostgreSQL and Redis in production.

00:26.000 --> 00:33.000
A CI/CD pipeline takes the code from git push through linting, tests, builds and a Docker image to a production deployment.

00:33.000 --> 00:39.000
Full-stack engineering, idea to production. Web, mobile, backend, real-time, IoT and deployment.

00:39.000 --> 00:45.000
Abdul Ahad, full-stack engineer at Floty.ai.
